  renf_hyp (fun st1 r => ret (st1, r)) o m0 st s (rcoreQ o m0 st s ra sp gp tp s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 s0v s1v s2v s3v s4v F fc n lo)
           ra sp gp tp s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 s0v s1v s2v s3v s4v F fc n lo.
